  honors:'Affordability is a ratio, basket cost ÷ income, and the answer depends on whose income. A full-time minimum wage, a mean, a median and an informal worker’s month give different answers. Household size, shocks like illness, and Engel’s law (poorer households spend a bigger share on food) change it again.',
